{
  "name": "CS toko AI di Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CS toko AI di Telegram\n1. Buat bot di @BotFather, buat credential **Telegram** dengan tokennya.\n2. Buat credential **OpenAI**: isi API key dan **Base URL** penyedia (contoh `https://api.ezkielyna.store/v1`).\n3. Ganti DATA TOKO di node **AI Agent** (Options → System Message).\n4. Aktifkan workflow. n8n harus bisa diakses lewat HTTPS agar Telegram bisa mengirim pesan.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "c461f5f3-85ac-51f2-bbb0-75bc20754ff2",
      "name": "Catatan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "3c164b25-2a87-5f4a-91d0-add7e9c29118",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "81cb3240-6304-559c-94a5-b919791b4950",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "name": "Telegram bot toko"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message.text || '(pembeli mengirim pesan selain teks)' }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Kamu adalah admin CS Toko Contoh. Jawab pertanyaan pembeli tentang produk, harga, ongkir, dan jam buka.\n\nAturan:\n- Bahasa Indonesia santai dan sopan, maksimal 3 kalimat.\n- Hanya pakai informasi di DATA TOKO. Kalau tidak ada, jawab: \"Sebentar ya kak, saya tanyakan ke admin dulu.\"\n- Jangan menjanjikan diskon, stok, atau waktu kirim yang tidak tertulis.\n- Kalau pembeli mengirim selain teks, minta dia menulis pertanyaannya.\n\nDATA TOKO (ganti dengan data tokomu):\n- Jam buka: Senin-Sabtu 08.00-20.00 WIB\n- Kopi susu 1 liter: Rp55.000\n- Ongkir dalam kota: Rp10.000, gratis di atas Rp150.000\n- Pembayaran: transfer bank, QRIS, COD dalam kota"
        }
      },
      "id": "78a72433-be51-58b9-a6d9-b22ae6788ee0",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "deepseek-v4.1-flash",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 400,
          "temperature": 0.4
        }
      },
      "id": "b6c2e108-b7d3-5e20-a7c7-e55012b79833",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        180,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "AI API (OpenAI-compatible)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 6
      },
      "id": "a1da91a2-86e7-53a3-b5f3-d65d42b7f9eb",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        340,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "a92f2184-eac6-59fe-8b00-9f185f77066d",
      "name": "Kirim balasan",
